VSWord BlockSuite Spike Vendor Notes
=====================================

This directory is for a dev-only feasibility spike. It must not be treated as a production dependency approval.

Generated bundle input:
- @blocksuite/presets@0.19.5 — MPL-2.0
- @blocksuite/blocks@0.19.5 (transitive) — MPL-2.0

Policy for this spike:
- Do not copy or modify upstream BlockSuite source files in VSWord.
- Do not vendor patched MPL files.
- If production ever uses MPL BlockSuite packages, preserve license notices and provide source availability as required by MPL-2.0.
- Preferred production track is MIT-only @blocksuite/affine@0.22.x if a direct edgeless editor assembly can be validated.

This file is a marker; generated index.js is a throwaway spike artifact.
